        value: "\302\251 2002-2016 International Health Terminology Standards Development Organisation (IHTSDO). All rights reserved. SNOMED CT\302\256, was originally created by The College of American Pathologists. \"SNOMED\" and \"SNOMED CT\" are registered trademarks of the IHTSDO http://www.ihtsdo.org/snomed-ct/get-snomed-ct"
      }
