      text {
        status {
          value: GENERATED
        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>Service type</h2><div><p>This value set defines an example set of codes of service-types.</p>\n</div><p>This code system http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/service-type defines many codes, of which the following are some examples:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1<a name=\"service-type-1\"> </a></td><td>Adoption/Permanent Care Info/Support</td><td>Adoption &amp; permanent care information/support</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2<a name=\"service-type-2\"> </a></td><td>Aged Care Assessment</td><td>Aged care assessment</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">3<a name=\"service-type-3\"> </a></td><td>Aged Care Information/Referral</td><td>Aged Care information/referral</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4<a name=\"service-type-4\"> </a></td><td>Aged Residential Care</td><td>Aged Residential Care</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5<a name=\"service-type-5\"> </a></td><td>Case Management for Older Persons</td><td>Case management for older persons</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">6<a name=\"service-type-6\"> </a></td><td>Delivered Meals (Meals On Wheels)</td><td>Delivered meals (meals on wheels)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">7<a name=\"service-type-7\"> </a></td><td>Friendly Visiting</td><td>Friendly visiting</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8<a name=\"service-type-8\"> </a></td><td>Home Care/Housekeeping Assistance</td><td>Home care/housekeeping assistance</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9<a name=\"service-type-9\"> </a></td><td>Home Maintenance and Repair</td><td>Home maintenance and repair</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10<a name=\"service-type-10\"> </a></td><td>Personal Alarms/Alerts</td><td>Personal alarms/alerts</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space: