        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>FlagStatus</h2><div><p>Indicates whether this flag is active and needs to be displayed to a user, or whether it is no longer needed or was entered in error.</p>\n</div><p>This code system http://hl7.org/fhir/flag-status defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">active<a name=\"flag-status-active\"> </a></td><td>Active</td><td>A current flag that should be displayed to a user. A system may use the category to determine which user roles should view the flag.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">inactive<a name=\"flag-status-inactive\"> </a></td><td>Inactive</td><td>The flag no longer needs to be displayed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">entered-in-error<a name=\"flag-status-entered-in-error\"> </a></td><td>Entered in Error</td><td>The flag was added in error and should no longer be displayed.</td></tr></table></div>"
