          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>Reason Medication Given Codes</h2><div><p>This value set is provided as an example. The value set to instantiate this attribute should be drawn from a robust terminology code system that consists of or contains concepts to support the medication process.</p>\n</div><p>This code system http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/reason-medication-given defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">a<a name=\"reason-medication-given-codes-a\"> </a></td><td>None</td><td>No reason known.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">b<a name=\"reason-medication-given-codes-b\"> </a></td><td>Given as Ordered</td><td>The administration was following an ordered protocol.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">c<a name=\"reason-medication-given-codes-c\"> </a></td><td>Emergency</td><td>The administration was needed to treat an emergency.</td></tr></table></div>"
