        definition {
          value: "A \'resource\' - a directed acyclic graph of elements that aggregrates other types into an identifiable entity. The base FHIR resources are defined by the FHIR specification itself but other \'resources\' can be defined in additional specifications (though these will not be recognised as \'resources\' by the FHIR specification (i.e. they do not get end-points etc, or act as the targets of references in FHIR defined resources - though other specificatiosn can treat them this way)."
        }
