      text {
        status {
          value: GENERATED
        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>Appointment cancellation reason</h2><div><p>This example value set defines a set of reasons for the cancellation of an appointment.</p>\n</div><p>This code system http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/appointment-cancellation-reason defines many codes, of which the following are some examples:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td><b>Lvl</b></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">pat<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat\"> </a></td><td>Patient</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-crs<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-crs\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Canceled via automated reminder system</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-cpp<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-cpp\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Canceled via Patient Portal</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-dec<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-dec\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Deceased</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-fb<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-fb\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Feeling Better</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-lt<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-lt\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Lack of Transportation</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-mt<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-mt\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Member Terminated</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-mv<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-mv\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Moved</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-preg<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-preg\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Pregnant</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-swl<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-swl\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Scheduled from Wait List</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240pat-ucp<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-pat-ucp\"> </a></td><td>Patient: Unhappy/Changed Provider</td><td/></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">prov<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-prov\"> </a></td><td>Provider</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240prov-pers<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-prov-pers\"> </a></td><td>Provider: Personal</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240prov-dch<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-prov-dch\"> </a></td><td>Provider: Discharged</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240prov-edu<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-prov-edu\"> </a></td><td>Provider: Edu/Meeting</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240prov-hosp<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-prov-hosp\"> </a></td><td>Provider: Hospitalized</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240prov-labs<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-prov-labs\"> </a></td><td>Provider: Labs Out of Acceptable Range</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240prov-mri<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-prov-mri\"> </a></td><td>Provider: MRI Screening Form Marked Do Not Proceed</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240prov-onc<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-prov-onc\"> </a></td><td>Provider: Oncology Treatment Plan Changes</td><td/></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">maint<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-maint\"> </a></td><td>Equipment Maintenance/Repair</td><td/></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">meds-inc<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-meds-inc\"> </a></td><td>Prep/Med Incomplete</td><td/></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-other\"> </a></td><td>Other</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-cms<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-oth-cms\"> </a></td><td>Other: CMS Therapy Cap Service Not Authorized</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-err<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-oth-err\"> </a></td><td>Other: Error</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-fin<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-oth-fin\"> </a></td><td>Other: Financial</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-iv<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-oth-iv\"> </a></td><td>Other: Improper IV Access/Infiltrate IV</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-int<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-oth-int\"> </a></td><td>Other: No Interpreter Available</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-mu<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-oth-mu\"> </a></td><td>Other: Prep/Med/Results Unavailable</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-room<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-oth-room\"> </a></td><td>Other: Room/Resource Maintenance</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-oerr<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-oth-oerr\"> </a></td><td>Other: Schedule Order Error</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-swie<a name=\"appointment-cancellation-reason-oth-swie\"> </a></td><td>Other: Silent Walk In Error</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\302\240\302\240oth-weath