      text {
        status {
          value: GENERATED
        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>CommunicationNotDoneReason</h2><div><p>Codes for the reason why a communication did not happen.</p>\n</div><p>This code system http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/communication-not-done-reason defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">unknown<a name=\"communication-not-done-reason-unknown\"> </a></td><td>Unknown</td><td>The communication was not done due to an unknown reason.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">system-error<a name=\"communication-not-done-reason-system-error\"> </a></td><td>System Error</td><td>The communication was not done due to a system error.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">invalid-phone-number<a name=\"communication-not-done-reason-invalid-phone-number\"> </a></td><td>Invalid Phone Number</td><td>The communication was not done due to an invalid phone number.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">recipient-unavailable<a name=\"communication-not-done-reason-recipient-unavailable\"> </a></td><td>Recipient Unavailable</td><td>The communication was not done due to the recipient being unavailable.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">family-objection<a name=\"communication-not-done-reason-family-objection\"> </a></td><td>Family Objection</td><td>The communication was not done due to a family objection.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">patient-objection<a name=\"communication-not-done-reason-patient-objection\"> </a></td><td>Patient Objection</td><td>The communication was not done due to a patient objection.</td></tr></table></div>"
