tain a known value.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eval<a name=\"assert-operator-codes-eval\"> </a></td><td>evaluate</td><td>Evaluate the FHIRPath expression as a boolean condition.</td></tr></table></div>"
