          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Each definition includes usage notes explaining\n            the precedence order in contract lifecycle - i.e., while only some stages are required,\n            the order in which they may occur is deterministic; and a map to comparable FHIR and v.3\n            status codes. It follows guidance about use of status codes in FHIR at\n            http://build.fhir.org/sc.html.<hr/><h2>Contract Resource Asset Type codes</h2><div><p>This value set contract specific codes for asset type.</p>\n</div><p><b>Copyright Statement:</b></p><div><p>HL7 International.</p>\n</div><p>This code system http://hl7.org/fhir/contract-asset-type defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">participation<a name=\"contract-assettype-participation\"> </a></td><td>Participation</td><td>To be completed</td></tr></table></div>"
