        }
      }
      text {
        status {
          value: GENERATED
        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>Consent Category Codes</h2><div><p>This value set includes sample Consent Directive Type codes, including several consent directive related LOINC codes; HL7 VALUE SET: ActConsentType(2.16.840.1.113883.1.11.19897); examples of US realm consent directive legal descriptions and references to online and/or downloadable forms such as the SSA-827 Authorization to Disclose Information to the Social Security Administration; and other anticipated consent directives related to participation in a clinical trial, medical procedures, reproductive procedures; health care directive (Living Will); advance directive, do not resuscitate (DNR); Physician Orders for Life-Sustaining Treatment (POLST)</p>\n</div><p><b>Copyright Statement:</b></p><div><p>This value set includes content from LOINC\302\256 which is copyright \302\251 1995 Regenstrief Institute, Inc. and the LOINC Committee, and available at no cost under the license at http://loinc.org/terms-of-use</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Include all codes defined in <a href=\"codesystem-consent-category.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/consentcategorycodes</code></a></li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"v3/ActConsentType/vs.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/ValueSet/v3-ActConsentType</a></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://loinc.org\"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://details.loinc.org/LOINC/59284-0.html\">59284-0</a></td><td>Patient Consent </td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://details.loinc.org/LOINC/57016-8.html\">57016-8</a></td><td>Privacy policy acknowledgement Document</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://details.loinc.org/LOINC/57017-6.html\">57017-6</a></td><td>Privacy policy Organization Document </td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://details.loinc.org/LOINC/64292-6.html\">64292-6</a></td><td>Release of information consent </td><td/></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
        }
      }
      extension {
        url {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/structuredefinition-wg"
        }
        value {
          code {
            value: "cbcc"
          }
        }
      }
      extension {
        url {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/structuredefinition-standards-status"
        }
        value {
