      text {
        status {
          value: GENERATED
        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>Immunization Recommendation Date Criterion Codes</h2><div><p>The value set to instantiate this attribute should be drawn from a terminologically robust code system that consists of or contains concepts to support the definition of dates relevant to recommendations for future doses of vaccines. This value set is provided as a suggestive example.</p>\n</div><p><b>Copyright Statement:</b></p><div><p>This content from LOINC\302\256 is copyright \302\251 1995 Regenstrief Institute, Inc. and the LOINC Committee, and available at no cost under the license at http://loinc.org/terms-of-use.</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://loinc.org\"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://details.loinc.org/LOINC/30981-5.html\">30981-5</a></td><td>Earliest date to give</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://details.loinc.org/LOINC/30980-7.html\">30980-7</a></td><td>Date vaccine due</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://details.loinc.org/LOINC/59777-3.html\">59777-3</a></td><td>Latest date to give immunization</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://details.loinc.org/LOINC/59778-1.html\">59778-1</a></td><td>Date when overdue for immunization</td><td/></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
