        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>Common Languages (Written)</h2><div><p>This value set includes common codes from BCP-47 (http://tools.ietf.org/html/bcp47) for the purpose of writing; this value set (unlike the common languages value set) doesn\'t include dialects except where they are relevant for written languages</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>urn:ietf:bcp:47</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>ar</td><td>Arabic</td><td/></tr><tr><td>bn</td><td>Bengali</td><td/></tr><tr><td>cs</td><td>Czech</td><td/></tr><tr><td>da</td><td>Danish</td><td/></tr><tr><td>de</td><td>German</td><td/></tr><tr><td>el</td><td>Greek</td><td/></tr><tr><td>en</td><td>English</td><td/></tr><tr><td>es</td><td>Spanish</td><td/></tr><tr><td>fi</td><td>Finnish</td><td/></tr><tr><td>fr</td><td>French</td><td/></tr><tr><td>fy</td><td>Frysian</td><td/></tr><tr><td>hi</td><td>Hindi</td><td/></tr><tr><td>hr</td><td>Croatian</td><td/></tr><tr><td>it</td><td>Italian</td><td/></tr><tr><td>ja</td><td>Japanese</td><td/></tr><tr><td>ko</td><td>Korean</td><td/></tr><tr><td>nl</td><td>Dutch</td><td/></tr><tr><td>no</td><td>Norwegian</td><td/></tr><tr><td>pa</td><td>Punjabi</td><td/></tr><tr><td>pl</td><td>Polish</td><td/></tr><tr><td>pt</td><td>Portuguese</td><td/></tr><tr><td>ru</td><td>Russian</td><td/></tr><tr><td>sr</td><td>Serbian</td><td/></tr><tr><td>sv</td><td>Swedish</td><td/></tr><tr><td>te</td><td>Telegu</td><td/></tr><tr><td>zh</td><td>Chinese</td><td/></tr></table></li></ul><p><b>Additional Language Displays</b></p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Dansk (Danish, da)</b></td><td><b>Deutsch (German, de)</b></td><td><b>English (English, en)</b></td><td><b>Nederlands (Dutch, nl)</b></td><td><b>Polskie (Polish, pl)</b></td><td><b>\320\240\321\203\321\201\321\201\320\272\32